OL,3,ARescuers dig through Ukraine mall
OL,4,Awreckage as Zelensky condemns
OL,5,A'despicable' Russian strike
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers in Ukraine are continuing
OL,8,Ftheir search for survivors in the
OL,9,Fwreckage of a big shopping centre hit
OL,10,Fby a Russian drone strike on Friday.
OL,12,FSixteen people were killed and 130
OL,13,Finjured when two drones hit the busy
OL,14,Fcentre in Kryvyi Rih in quick
OL,15,Fsuccession in what is known as a
OL,16,Fdouble-tap strike. Four people are
OL,17,Fstill missing. The search and rescue
OL,18,Foperation could last for another two
OL,19,Fdays.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
