OL,3,ARescuers dig through Ukraine mall
OL,4,Awreckage as Zelensky condemns
OL,5,A'despicable' Russian strike
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky condemned
OL,8,Fthe "cynical and despicable" attack in
OL,9,Fwhich the second drone targeted
OL,10,Femergency workers.
OL,12,FThe sides exchanged more fire
OL,13,Fovernight, with Ukrainian attacks said
OL,14,Fto have killed at least four people in
OL,15,FRussia, including two children, and two
OL,16,Fpeople reported dead by Kyiv as a
OL,17,Fresult of Russian strikes.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
